Implemented GEO2 URL crawl ingestion with bounded, deterministic URL fetching and tests.

**File Scope**
- [src/pipeline/extract.py](/private/tmp/agent-swarm/worktrees/geo2-url-crawl-ingestion-2/src/pipeline/extract.py):1
- [src/pipeline/url_ingest.py](/private/tmp/agent-swarm/worktrees/geo2-url-crawl-ingestion-2/src/pipeline/url_ingest.py):1
- [src/cli/ingest_url.py](/private/tmp/agent-swarm/worktrees/geo2-url-crawl-ingestion-2/src/cli/ingest_url.py):1
- [tests/test_extract.py](/private/tmp/agent-swarm/worktrees/geo2-url-crawl-ingestion-2/tests/test_extract.py):1
- [tests/test_ingest_url.py](/private/tmp/agent-swarm/worktrees/geo2-url-crawl-ingestion-2/tests/test_ingest_url.py):1

**What Was Added**
- URL validation and safety controls:
  - Only `http/https`
  - Hostname required
  - URL userinfo blocked
  - Blocked/unsafe host checks (`localhost`, metadata/internal hosts, private/loopback/link-local/reserved IPs)
- Bounded network behavior:
  - Explicit timeout (`--timeout-seconds`)
  - Explicit max response size (`--max-bytes`)
  - `Content-Length` pre-check + read-limit enforcement
- Deterministic failure modes via coded errors:
  - `INVALID_URL`, `UNSAFE_URL`, `BLOCKED_DOMAIN`, `TIMEOUT`, `FETCH_FAILED`, `OVERSIZED_RESPONSE`, `UNSUPPORTED_CONTENT_TYPE`, `EMPTY_CONTENT`
- Normalized text extraction preserved (HTML visible text + whitespace normalization).
