  - Explicit timeout (`--timeout-seconds`)
  - Explicit max response size (`--max-bytes`)
  - `Content-Length` pre-check + read-limit enforcement
- Deterministic failure modes via coded errors:
  - `INVALID_URL`, `UNSAFE_URL`, `BLOCKED_DOMAIN`, `TIMEOUT`, `FETCH_FAILED`, `OVERSIZED_RESPONSE`, `UNSUPPORTED_CONTENT_TYPE`, `EMPTY_CONTENT`
